WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.899
Step 1. Open the questionnaire list.

1.2
00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:08.343
You give a new questionnaire a title, a slug, a status and a subject type,

1.3
00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:11.065
and add the questions after you save.

1.4
00:00:11.065 --> 00:00:15.097
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires.

2.1
00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:19.612
Step 2. Start a new questionnaire. Select Create Questionnaire.

2.2
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:25.799
Care opens the Create Questionnaire page, with a Facility badge next to the heading.

3.1
00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:28.679
Step 3. Fill in the basic information.

3.2
00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:32.417
Enter a Title, and Care fills in the Slug as you type.

3.3
00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:37.277
The slug must not match another questionnaire in your facility.

4.1
00:00:37.277 --> 00:00:40.140
Step 4. Set the questionnaire properties.

4.2
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.409
Staff can fill in the questionnaire only when its Status is Active.

4.3
00:00:44.409 --> 00:00:49.241
You cannot change the Subject Type after you save the questionnaire.

5.1
00:00:49.241 --> 00:00:53.735
Step 5. Save the questionnaire. Select Save Questionnaire.

5.2
00:00:53.735 --> 00:00:58.199
Care opens the new questionnaire, which has no questions yet.

5.3
00:00:58.199 --> 00:01:01.699
Then use Edit Questions to add questions.
